# CineVision AI

Automatic Cinematography Technique Detection Using Deep Learning

## Objective

Detect cinematography techniques from video using
computer vision and deep learning.

## Planned Techniques

### Shot Type
- Extreme Close-Up
- Close-Up
- Medium Shot
- Long Shot
- Extreme Long Shot

### Camera Angle
- Eye Level
- High Angle
- Low Angle
- Dutch Angle

### Camera Movement
- Static
- Pan
- Tilt
- Dolly In
- Dolly Out
- Tracking
- Handheld